01:18:55,062 --> 01:18:58,403
[SPEAKER_01]: McCarthy's sitting here trying to tell him how to play the hitters.

1135
01:19:00,355 --> 01:19:03,816
[SPEAKER_01]: And he finally, McCarthy couldn't get Doar's attention.

1136
01:19:05,036 --> 01:19:10,017
